## Codebase Patterns
- `npm test` bundles and runs `test/index.ts` through `tapout`; Vitest tests
  live beside it and should be run directly with `npx vitest run <file>` for
  targeted checks.
- SPA state follows the template pattern: mutable app behavior is attached to
  the exported `State` function rather than scattered across components.
- The home route owns the Atrament canvas lifecycle and keeps drawing controls
  in component-local signals.
- Netlify Database migrations live under
  `netlify/database/migrations/<prefix>_<slug>/migration.sql`.
- Netlify Blobs helpers should call `getStore(...)` lazily inside exported
  operations, not at module load, so Netlify runtime context is available.

